# Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|----------|--------|
| Rule-based calculations | Higher accuracy and deterministic outputs |
| Retrieval before generation | Reduce hallucinations |
| Validation before response | Guarantee nutritional correctness |
| LLM only for reasoning | Lower cost and improved consistency |
| Independent components | Easier testing and maintenance |

